3752
00:34:10,020 --> 00:34:11,770
<font face="Bahij Nassim" size="112"><b>أرخيت دفاعك</b></font>

3753
00:34:43,560 --> 00:34:44,850
<font face="Bahij Nassim" size="112"><b>لا أستطيع نزعه</b></font>

3754
00:34:56,150 --> 00:34:58,850
<font face="Bahij Nassim" size="112"><b>سأستعمل هذا إذن</b></font>

3755
00:35:11,800 --> 00:35:13,500
<font face="Bahij Nassim" size="112"><b>...ثلاثة</b></font>

3756
00:35:14,100 --> 00:35:16,050
<font face="Bahij Nassim" size="112"><b>سيوف؟</b></font>

3757
